# Interaction Modes

> Fuente: https://www.chartjs.org/docs/latest/samples/tooltip/interactions.html
> Exportado: 2026-07-12 20:59 UTC

# [#](#interaction-modes) Interaction Modes

This sample shows how to use the tooltip position mode setting.

config
setup
actions

const config = {
type: 'line',
data: data,
options: {
interaction: {
intersect: false,
mode: 'index',
},
plugins: {
title: {
display: true,
text: (ctx) => {
const {axis = 'xy', intersect, mode} = ctx.chart.options.interaction;
return 'Mode: ' + mode + ', axis: ' + axis + ', intersect: ' + intersect;
}
},
}
}
};

